  itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ce4ccefcb21b9c8489c87c7610887d55, type: 3}
  questionName: Ask About Burnt Note
  evidenceType: 1
  itemDescription: "A scrap of paper with burnt edges. The visible line says, \u201CI
    know what you did.\u201D The sheet is fragile but additional words may be recoverable
    through careful  treatment. Handle with care \u2014 photos will only capture
    what\u2019s visible."
  playerDialogue: "Part of a note \u2014 \u2018I know what you did.\u2019 The edges
    are charred. A photo won\u2019t recover the missing words; I need to bag this
    and get it treated."
  explanation: What?! Just forget that note, haha. My mate just wrote it as a prank.
  canBeInspected: 1
  isComputer: 0
  holdDistance: 2.5
  rotationSpeed: 100
  doorAnimator: {fileID: 0}
