  m_text: "Still\u2026 the way he\u2019s been acting lately \u2014 keeping to himself,
    looking over his shoulder, leaving town for \u201Codd jobs\u201D at strange hours
    \u2014 it all lines up with something bad. I just can\u2019t tell which one he\u2019s
    responsible for."
