      propertyPath: playerDialogue
      value: "Hidden away\u2026 the other mans face is erased. This went through
        great lengths to be hidden. No way I\u2019m taking the whole photo \u2014
        a snapshot will have to do."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6950276933440249287, guid: 7ac04a31b0a0ffd4fb085cc9c913d3d6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: itemDescription
      value: A photograph of Mr.Michaels and someone together during a hunting trip.
        The other guys face has been deliberately blacked out. The photo was found
        hidden away in a drawer, suggesting someone wanted to conceal it. A photograph
        will be enough to document this clue.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
